2. System Architecture: Separation of Planes and Datapath Enforcement

The core design principle of the ValueOS architecture is the complete insulation of the inference engine from state-changing primitives.

```text
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                      REASONING PLANE                       |
|    (LLM Agents, Unbounded Planning, Probabilistic State)   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
                             |
            [ Unsigned Tool-Call Intention (JSON) ]
                             v
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                    DATAPATH ENFORCEMENT                    |
|                 (Deterministic Policy Engine)              |
|                                                            |
|   1. Cryptographic Verification (Ed25519)                  |
|   2. Semantic Boundary Interception                        |
|   3. Non-Compensatory Evaluation (Fail-Closed)             |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
                             |
